{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，熊喵在這裡啊？」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4467", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕？」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "pn0411", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學走到暖爐旁取暖，手放在嘴邊呵氣。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，瀨名同學？」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剛才，我在我家公寓附近看到這孩子，還以為牠是去散步了。」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4468", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剛才？熊喵一直都在社團教室裡喔……」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？那大概是我看錯了……」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4469", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一開始說要當幽靈社員的瀨名同學，現在只要有時間就會來社團露臉。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如今她也習慣熊喵了，還會主動開罐頭給牠吃。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵也跑到瀨名同學腳邊，露出肚子給她看。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒想到我能看見這一天到來呢……", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼，今天外面也好冷……」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ag3453", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇哇，熊喵小姐是學會瞬間移動的招式了嗎？」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ag3454", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕嚕？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "pn0412", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，安潔？」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比瀨名同學更忙的安潔，現在也是有空就會來社團。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過她是什麼意思呢？熊喵學會瞬間移動……", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔剛才去各務台商場買東西，看到熊喵小姐慢吞吞地在走路呢！」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ag3455", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒想到比起光速趕回來的安潔，熊喵小姐居然更早到社團了！」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ag3456", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然光速是誇張了點，不過這種奇怪的目擊情報增加了啊……", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「各務台商場？熊喵一直待在社團教室對吧？」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4470", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，沒有錯。」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～？」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "pn0413", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都不禁歪著頭思考。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……熊喵會分身術。」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sk1333", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「難道櫻乃也在哪裡看見熊喵了？」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4471", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剛才迷路的時候，在山路。」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sk1334", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「迷路的話應該打電話給我的啊。」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃是肯努力就辦得到的孩子。」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sk1335", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「同樣身為路痴，我有種輸了的感覺……」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4472", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是隨便走走而已。」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sk1336", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是那樣才危險。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，又增加了新的目擊情報。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這不是單純看錯就能解釋的程度。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也就是說……", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂、不得了了！媽媽喵、媽媽喵出現了！」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1614", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「冷靜一點，紗凪。怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4473", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我就說了，外面有媽媽喵出現了！」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1615", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「媽媽喵？」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一個沒聽過的專有名詞。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵，高興吧，找到妳的媽媽了！」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1616", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕嚕～？」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "pn0414", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵的……」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sk1337", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「媽媽？」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4474", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原來如此，像貓熊一樣的貓的媽媽，所以叫做媽媽喵啊！」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ag3457", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不討論紗凪的取名品味。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是真的嗎？」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我親眼看到的！在我家附近，有一隻體型較大的熊喵出現了。」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1617", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，那也沒辦法確定是熊喵的母親……」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「除此之外哪裡還有那麼罕見的生物啦！而且，牠身邊還有其他小熊喵。」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1618", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那或許是熊喵的姊弟也說不定。」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1619", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除非我自己也看到，不然有點難相信。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……大家都來了啊，辛苦了～」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2145", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊，請聽我說！我終於找到熊喵的母親了！」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1620", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2146", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還活著喔，熊喵的家人！牠們沒有死！」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1621", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2147", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～？」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "pn0415", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這不是很好嗎，熊喵。妳的媽媽好像還活著喔。」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4475", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕！」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "pn0416", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣熊喵就能再見到家人了呢！」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ag3458", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔，想太遠了。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sk1338", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，首先要找出媽媽喵的出沒地點才行。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1622", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2148", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……欸？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2149", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、什麼？新吾君，怎麼了嗎？」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2150", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊沒事吧？她好像很恍神……", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼接下來，就要啟動熊喵作戰了呢！」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ag3459", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真沒辦法。我就在公寓附近找看看吧。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "ar4476", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟愛理一起去。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sk1339", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔就以學校周邊為主搜尋！」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ag3460", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，我就去找我家附近的森林。」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "sn1623", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都各自說出自己搜尋的範圍，離開了社團。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2151", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "pn0417", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……小熊喵的媽媽，還活著啊。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2152", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然還無法確定，但可能性很高的樣子。」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2153", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感覺得到學姊很困惑。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "找到母親的話，熊喵就能跟其他動物一樣回歸自然。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是對學姊來說，那不是簡單的事。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵跟其他沒有取名字的動物們不同。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們都把牠當成家人一樣相處。", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵，妳媽媽還活著喔。太好了呢。」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2154", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～？」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "pn0418", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2155", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊沒有繼續說話，只是抱緊了熊喵……", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天我來到學姊家，等她打工結束。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為熊喵的事，她看起來很沒精神，但我只能擔心地等待著。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊，原來是熊喵小姐的母親。」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0186", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊聽說了這件事後好像很困惑的樣子。」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想也是。因為那孩子非常疼愛熊喵小姐……」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0187", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊沒事吧？」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒事的喔，因為有新吾同學在♪」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0188", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老實說，我不知道自己能為學姊做些什麼事。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "應該和大家一起去找熊喵的母親嗎？我連這點判斷都辦不到。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……以前，我跟新吾同學說過對吧？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0189", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽小時候，家裡的小貓因為生病過世，之後她就害怕飼養生物……」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0190", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說過。」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是喔。小時候，老家養的貓……」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0191", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那隻貓自然衰老死亡的時候，我以為我再也不會養貓了。」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0192", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "ドモン", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喵嗚～」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "朵萌", "alt_speaker_idx": 442, "voice": "dm0006", "char_id": "ドモン"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "カリン", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喵～」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "花鈴", "alt_speaker_idx": 458, "voice": "kr0006", "char_id": "カリン"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，果然還是養了呢♪」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0193", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽她看到朵萌和花鈴的時候一定很難受……」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0194", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是學姊很疼貓咪們。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「即使如此，牠們也只是『媽媽的貓』。那孩子不會讓自己再更進一步……」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0195", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且，對熊喵小姐也是……」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0196", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「希望有一天那孩子能振作起來，變得能跟動物們一起生活呢♪」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0197", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也希望那一天到來。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望她不要逃避最喜歡的東西，能寵愛牠們。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……結子小姐是為什麼會又想養貓呢？」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0198", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛……因為我成為了媽媽吧？」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0199", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "カリン", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喵嗚～」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "花鈴", "alt_speaker_idx": 458, "voice": "kr0007", "char_id": "カリン"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "ドモン", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喵～」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "朵萌", "alt_speaker_idx": 442, "voice": "dm0007", "char_id": "ドモン"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好好，想吃乾乾了對吧？跟我來吧。」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 454, "voice": "yk0200", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結子小姐走向廚房，她的背影在我眼中與美羽學姊重疊。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望有一天，能像結子小姐一樣。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想看到她跟最喜歡的貓咪們幸福生活的模樣。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在比任何人都近的地方看著她。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔，你一直在等我吧。」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2156", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打工辛苦了。」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2157", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？我的臉上有沾到什麼嗎？」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有。只是就想看著你♪」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2158", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好害羞喔。」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸～明明都交往了？」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2159", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那學姊會怎麼樣呢？」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔。」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2160", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我反過來凝視著她。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這、這個嘛，有點害羞呢……」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2161", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然臉紅的學姊好可愛。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看這樣子她應該沒事了，感覺是平常的美羽學姊……", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，對了對了，關於小熊喵的事……」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2162", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是。」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果找到牠的媽媽了，我想立刻就讓牠回歸自然。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2163", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看得出來她在強顏歡笑。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對小熊喵來說，那樣才是幸福嘛♪」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2164", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，這就是學姊選擇的答案吧。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那麼我也只能從旁守護她。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "待在她身邊，見證這一切。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那明天開始，就去找熊喵的媽媽吧。」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。希望快點找到，讓小熊喵高興。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "mu2165", "char_id": "みう"}]}
